  tomiren:{label:'COLLABORATIVE BUILD / IN PROGRESS',title:'TomiRen',intro:'Building a trustworthy storefront, with correctness in the foundations.',problem:'Shopping experiences need dependable catalog/search workflows before ambitious payment and pricing features can be trusted.',focus:'My recorded contributions include catalog and product-detail APIs, PostgreSQL search and suggestions, shared validation contracts, reusable UI/filter controls, and query-plan analysis with a seeded 50k-product dataset.',scope:'Catalog, filtering, sorting, and search are present in the reviewed source. Accounts, cart, checkout, payments, and admin workflows are planned milestones. Price history is planned; Split-Pay is a later v2 feature. Repository access is required.',tags:['React / TypeScript','Express','PostgreSQL','Drizzle','Zod'],links:[['Repository (access required)','https://github.com/Saroj-Pedada/TomiRen']]}
